#+ Text deviations for American Truck Simulator. Please, use only terms appropriate for USA (i.e. culture specific nuances, not American English).
#@{

#+ Music/radio player
#@{

#+ Hint shown if no music files are found. Also shown as tooltip when hovering over music_player button.

	key[]: "music_player_hint"
	val[]: "Поставете своите песни в папка <color value=@@clr_sel@@>American Truck Simulator/music <color value=@@clr_txt@@>във вашата <color value=@@clr_sel@@>Documents <color value=@@clr_txt@@> папка и ще ги видите тук."

#+ Tooltip shown when hovering over the radio_stream button.

	key[]: "radio_hint"
	val[]: "Променете файла <color value=@@clr_sel@@>live_streams.sii <color value=@@clr_txt@@>, намиращ се в папка <color value=@@clr_sel@@>American Truck Simulator <color value=@@clr_txt@@>в <color value=@@clr_sel@@>Documents <color value=@@clr_txt@@>, ако искате да слушате любимото си, докато шофирате!"

#+ Hint shown if no online radio streams are defined.

	key[]: "empty_radio_hint"
	val[]: "Моля, прочетете файла <color value=@@clr_sel@@>readme.rtf <color value=@@clr_txt@@>, намиращ се в папка <color value=@@clr_sel@@>American Truck Simulator <color value=@@clr_txt@@>в <color value=@@clr_sel@@>Documents <color value=@@clr_txt@@>, за да разберете как да добавите своя музика или радио поток."
#@}

